  "contract": [
    "Replace add_huge VADD assembly with ordinary C addition to a volatile float. Retain the addition on integral early-return paths, including its inexact/input-denormal status effects.",
    "Replace VCMPE-zero/VMRS assembly with encoded float classification and FPSCR compiler builtins. Set IOC for every NaN, honor FZ input-denormal flushing/IDC, set exact NZCV outcomes and preserve existing low FPSCR control/status bits. NaN and FZ-denormal absolute-value inputs retain their original encodings because the native carry predicate is set.",
    "Replace MSR APSR_nzcvq assembly with __builtin_arm_wsr. It emits exactly the same object as the already tested arithmetic candidate. R0/NZCV and clearingQ are checked against native plus independent integer-ordering expectations in8704 calls. GE could not be seeded through the Unicorn register API; the unchanged architectural MSR instruction supplies that preservation evidence.",
    "One assembly bridge remains: r1_native_fabs_core_bits exposes the result in both core registers andD0. Removing it requires a separate caller/interface proof. No writable state or coefficient ownership changes.",
    "The normal product has identical sections, relocations and symbol contracts to the tested probe, except its nonallocated source-file name string.904 prior nongenerated source/object pairs from the intermediate spectral-parent build are unchanged. Compared with the previous accepted harmonic build, the combined parent/math changes leave902 other pairs unchanged and one caller interface-only source change with an unchanged object."
  ],
