    "Six compiled defects are rejected: omitted inexact addition, missing denormal flush/IDC, missing invalid flag, wrong zero flags and clearing previous FPSCR state. Full S0/FPSCR, saved registers, SP/masks and public RAM match in the arithmetic differential fixture. APSR is caller-clobbered and outside that arithmetic proof; the flag-returning integer helper has a separate explicit APSR proof.",
